    "detailed_description": "You find yourself crashed landed on an alien archipelago, Rimorius. A small creature begins to follow you along the island and a distant war horn blows as it becomes nightfall. Discover the power of Fledglings through your care and resilience. <br><br><strong>Creature Collection</strong><br>Nurture and protect young Fledglings until they reach adulthood. Build a party of different Fledglings that have their own meal preferences, behaviors, and attack patterns.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>Wave Defense</strong><br>Meet territorial enemies from the deep abyss. They come in swarms and various forms to drive your off of their homeland. Fight each night to continue to survive and grow your Fledglings. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Experience dynamic weather and lighting for an immersive Day/Night cycle. Enjoy the relaxing, bright nature of the day and be prepared to fight in the dark, creepy night. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Beat Your Highscore</strong><br>Progress at your own pace and determine the difficulty of your run by traversing different islands. Those who seek out a challenge will be rewarded.",
    "about_the_game": "You find yourself crashed landed on an alien archipelago, Rimorius. A small creature begins to follow you along the island and a distant war horn blows as it becomes nightfall. Discover the power of Fledglings through your care and resilience. <br><br><strong>Creature Collection</strong><br>Nurture and protect young Fledglings until they reach adulthood. Build a party of different Fledglings that have their own meal preferences, behaviors, and attack patterns.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/50bdb17e5108763dbb5f87e950c6a421.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>Wave Defense</strong><br>Meet territorial enemies from the deep abyss. They come in swarms and various forms to drive your off of their homeland. Fight each night to continue to survive and grow your Fledglings. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/58f48d08b9c572cf25cccc624bdaee18.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Experience dynamic weather and lighting for an immersive Day/Night cycle. Enjoy the relaxing, bright nature of the day and be prepared to fight in the dark, creepy night. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.poster.avif?t=1740441646\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.webm?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770140/extras/a79be059b9d82ee6f73fa15e967531d0.mp4?t=1740441646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Beat Your Highscore</strong><br>Progress at your own pace and determine the difficulty of your run by traversing different islands. Those who seek out a challenge will be rewarded.",
    "short_description": "Crash landed on an alien archipelago, you must raise native Fledglings to fight off waves of sea creatures at night. Collect Fledglings, scavenge for resources, and survive the nights with the help of your companions.",
